#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:4
msgid "OpenSearch"
msgstr "OpenSearch"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:6
msgid ""
"OpenSearch provides log aggregation, metrics storage, and full-text "
"search for |morpheus|. This page covers setting up and configuring "
"OpenSearch when running it as an external or distributed service."
msgstr "O OpenSearch fornece agregação de logs, armazenamento de métricas e pesquisa de texto completo para o |morpheus|. Esta página cobre a configuração do OpenSearch ao executá-lo como serviço externo ou distribuído."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:8
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:10
msgid ""
"For HVM deployments and all-in-one installations, OpenSearch is embedded "
"and requires no configuration. This page is only relevant when running "
"OpenSearch externally or in a multi-node embedded cluster."
msgstr "Para implantações HVM e instalações all-in-one, o OpenSearch é incorporado e não exige configuração. Esta página só é relevante ao executar o OpenSearch externamente ou em um cluster incorporado multi-nó."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:13
msgid "Settings Reference"
msgstr "Referência de Configurações"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:15
msgid ""
"The following settings control OpenSearch behavior. They can be set in "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` under the ``opensearch[...]`` namespace (or"
" the legacy ``elasticsearch[...]`` namespace — values are bridged "
"automatically, with ``opensearch[...]`` taking precedence)."
msgstr "As seguintes configurações controlam o comportamento do OpenSearch. Elas podem ser definidas em ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` sob o namespace ``opensearch[...]`` (ou o namespace legado ``elasticsearch[...]`` — os valores são conectados automaticamente, com ``opensearch[...]`` tendo precedência)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:21
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Configuração"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:22
msgid "opensearch.yml Mapping"
msgstr "Mapeamento opensearch.yml"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:23
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Finalidade"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:24
msgid "``enable``"
msgstr "``enable``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:25
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:46
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:49
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:52
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enable/disable the embedded OpenSearch service. Set to ``false`` when "
"using an external cluster. Default ``true``."
msgstr "Ativar/desativar o serviço OpenSearch incorporado. Defina como ``false`` ao usar um cluster externo. Padrão ``true``."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:27
msgid "``es_hosts``"
msgstr "``es_hosts``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:28
msgid "``cluster.initial_master_nodes``, ``discovery.seed_hosts``"
msgstr "``cluster.initial_master_nodes``, ``discovery.seed_hosts``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:29
msgid ""
"Cluster membership and discovery. For external clusters, lists the "
"external hosts."
msgstr "Associação e descoberta do cluster. Para clusters externos, lista os hosts externos."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:30
msgid "``node_name``"
msgstr "``node_name``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:31
msgid "``node.name``"
msgstr "``node.name``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:32
msgid "Unique name for this node within the cluster."
msgstr "Nome exclusivo para este nó dentro do cluster."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:33
msgid "``host``"
msgstr "``host``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:34
msgid "``network.host`` or ``network.bind_host``"
msgstr "``network.host`` ou ``network.bind_host``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:35
msgid ""
"Interface to bind to. Default ``127.0.0.1``. Set to ``0.0.0.0`` for "
"cluster use."
msgstr "Interface à qual se vincular. Padrão ``127.0.0.1``. Defina como ``0.0.0.0`` para uso em cluster."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:36
msgid "``publish_ip``"
msgstr "``publish_ip``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:37
msgid "``network.publish_host``"
msgstr "``network.publish_host``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:38
msgid ""
"The IP other nodes use to reach this node. Falls back to Ohai's "
"``node['ipaddress']`` if not set."
msgstr "O IP que outros nós usam para alcançar este nó. Recorre ao ``node['ipaddress']`` do Ohai se não estiver definido."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:39
msgid "``secure_mode``"
msgstr "``secure_mode``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:40
msgid "``plugins.security.disabled: false``, TLS config"
msgstr "``plugins.security.disabled: false``, configuração TLS"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:41
msgid ""
"Enables TLS on HTTP and transport layers, generates certs, runs "
"securityadmin.sh."
msgstr "Ativa TLS nas camadas HTTP e de transporte, gera certificados e executa securityadmin.sh."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:42
msgid "``cluster``"
msgstr "``cluster``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:43
msgid "``cluster.name``"
msgstr "``cluster.name``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:44
msgid "Cluster name. Defaults to ``morpheus``. Must be the same on all nodes."
msgstr "Nome do cluster. O padrão é ``morpheus``. Deve ser o mesmo em todos os nós."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:45
msgid "``use_tls``"
msgstr "``use_tls``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:47
msgid ""
"Connect to OpenSearch over HTTPS. Automatically set to ``true`` when "
"``secure_mode`` is enabled on the embedded service. Set manually for "
"external TLS clusters."
msgstr "Conectar ao OpenSearch por HTTPS. Definido automaticamente como ``true`` quando ``secure_mode`` está ativado no serviço incorporado. Defina manualmente para clusters TLS externos."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:48
msgid "``auth_user``"
msgstr "``auth_user``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:50
msgid ""
"Username for |morpheus| to authenticate with OpenSearch. Used for "
"external clusters. When nil and ``secure_mode`` is enabled, the auto-"
"created ``morpheus`` internal user is used."
msgstr "Nome de usuário para o |morpheus| autenticar no OpenSearch. Usado para clusters externos. Quando nil e ``secure_mode`` está ativado, o usuário interno ``morpheus`` criado automaticamente é usado."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:51
msgid "``auth_password``"
msgstr "``auth_password``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:53
msgid "Password for ``auth_user``. Used for external clusters."
msgstr "Senha para ``auth_user``. Usada para clusters externos."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:54
msgid "``replica_count``"
msgstr "``replica_count``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:55
msgid "``numberOfReplicas``"
msgstr "``numberOfReplicas``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:56
msgid ""
"Number of index replicas. Default ``1``. Set to ``0`` for single-node "
"deployments."
msgstr "Número de réplicas de índice. Padrão ``1``. Defina como ``0`` para implantações de nó único."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:57
msgid "``admin_dn``"
msgstr "``admin_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:58
msgid "``plugins.security.authcz.admin_dn``"
msgstr "``plugins.security.authcz.admin_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:59
msgid ""
"Distinguished name for the admin certificate. Defaults to "
"``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."
msgstr "Nome distinto do certificado de admin. O padrão é ``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:60
msgid "``nodes_dn``"
msgstr "``nodes_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:61
msgid "``plugins.security.nodes_dn``"
msgstr "``plugins.security.nodes_dn``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:62
msgid ""
"Distinguished name for trusted node certificates. Defaults to "
"``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."
msgstr "Nome distinto dos certificados de nó confiáveis. O padrão é ``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>``."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:65
msgid "Ports"
msgstr "Portas"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:67
msgid "Ensure the following ports are open between all OpenSearch cluster nodes:"
msgstr "Certifique-se de que as seguintes portas estejam abertas entre todos os nós do cluster OpenSearch:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:69
msgid "**9200** — HTTP (client queries)"
msgstr "**9200** — HTTP (consultas de cliente)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:70
msgid "**9300** — Transport (inter-node communication and cluster formation)"
msgstr "**9300** — Transporte (comunicação entre nós e formação do cluster)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:73
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Notas"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:75
msgid ""
"You can use either ``elasticsearch[...]`` or ``opensearch[...]`` keys in "
"``morpheus.rb``. The ``elasticsearch`` keys are bridged to ``opensearch``"
" automatically. If the same key is set under both namespaces, the "
"``opensearch[...]`` value takes precedence."
msgstr "Você pode usar as chaves ``elasticsearch[...]`` ou ``opensearch[...]`` no ``morpheus.rb``. As chaves ``elasticsearch`` são conectadas automaticamente a ``opensearch``. Se a mesma chave for definida sob ambos os namespaces, o valor ``opensearch[...]`` tem precedência."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:76
msgid ""
"The reconfigure strips ``127.0.0.1`` from ``es_hosts`` when more than one"
" host is present, so you don't need to exclude it."
msgstr "O reconfigure remove ``127.0.0.1`` de ``es_hosts`` quando há mais de um host presente, portanto você não precisa excluí-lo."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:77
msgid ""
"In secure mode, ``admin_dn`` and ``nodes_dn`` default to "
"``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>`` and are set automatically per node. "
"These only need to be overridden when using custom certificates."
msgstr "No modo seguro, ``admin_dn`` e ``nodes_dn`` têm o padrão ``O=Morpheus,OU=Ops,CN=<node_name>`` e são definidos automaticamente por nó. Eles só precisam ser substituídos ao usar certificados personalizados."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:80
msgid "Custom Certificates"
msgstr "Certificados Personalizados"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:82
msgid ""
"When using your own certificates instead of the auto-generated ones, set "
"``admin_dn`` and ``nodes_dn`` to match the subject DN of your "
"certificates:"
msgstr "Ao usar seus próprios certificados em vez dos gerados automaticamente, defina ``admin_dn`` e ``nodes_dn`` para corresponder ao subject DN dos seus certificados:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:84
msgid ""
"``admin_dn`` — Identifies the certificate authorized to run "
"administrative operations (e.g., ``securityadmin.sh``). Only requests "
"signed by a certificate matching this DN can modify the security index."
msgstr "``admin_dn`` — Identifica o certificado autorizado a executar operações administrativas (por exemplo, ``securityadmin.sh``). Somente solicitações assinadas por um certificado correspondente a este DN podem modificar o índice de segurança."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:85
msgid ""
"``nodes_dn`` — Identifies certificates trusted for inter-node transport "
"communication. Nodes will reject transport connections from certificates "
"that don't match."
msgstr "``nodes_dn`` — Identifica certificados confiáveis para comunicação de transporte entre nós. Os nós rejeitarão conexões de transporte de certificados que não correspondam."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:87
msgid "To extract the subject DN from an existing certificate:"
msgstr "Para extrair o subject DN de um certificado existente:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:89
msgid "openssl x509 -in /path/to/cert.pem -noout -subject -nameopt RFC2253"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:93
msgid "Set the values in ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each node:"
msgstr "Defina os valores em ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` em cada nó:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:95
msgid ""
"opensearch['admin_dn'] = 'CN=admin,OU=MyTeam,O=MyOrg'\n"
"opensearch['nodes_dn'] = 'CN=node,OU=MyTeam,O=MyOrg'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the admin and node certificates share the same DN (common when a "
"single wildcard or shared cert is used), both values can be set to the "
"same string."
msgstr "Se os certificados de admin e de nó compartilharem o mesmo DN (comum quando um único certificado curinga ou compartilhado é usado), ambos os valores podem ser definidos com a mesma string."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:103
msgid "Setting the Morpheus User Password"
msgstr "Definindo a Senha do Usuário Morpheus"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:105
msgid ""
"When ``secure_mode`` is enabled, reconfigure creates an internal "
"OpenSearch user named ``morpheus`` that |morpheus| uses to authenticate. "
"The password is auto-generated and stored in ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-"
"secrets.json`` under the ``elasticsearch.morpheus_password`` key. No "
"manual configuration is needed in the default case."
msgstr "Quando ``secure_mode`` está ativado, o reconfigure cria um usuário interno do OpenSearch chamado ``morpheus`` que o |morpheus| usa para autenticar. A senha é gerada automaticamente e armazenada em ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json`` sob a chave ``elasticsearch.morpheus_password``. Nenhuma configuração manual é necessária no caso padrão."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:107
msgid ""
"To set a custom password, add it to ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each"
" node:"
msgstr "Para definir uma senha personalizada, adicione-a a ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` em cada nó:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:109
msgid "opensearch['morpheus_password'] = 'my-custom-password'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:114
msgid "Encrypting Passwords"
msgstr "Criptografando Senhas"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:116
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Passwords in ``morpheus.rb`` can be stored in encrypted form using the "
"``ENC{...}`` wrapper. During reconfigure, the recipe detects the ``ENC`` "
"prefix and decrypts the value automatically."
msgstr "As senhas no ``morpheus.rb`` podem ser armazenadas de forma criptografada usando o wrapper ``ENC{...}``. Durante o reconfigure, a recipe detecta o prefixo ``ENC`` e descriptografa o valor automaticamente."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:118
msgid "To generate an encrypted string:"
msgstr "Para gerar uma string criptografada:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:120
msgid "morpheus-ctl get-crypto-string string 'my-custom-password'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:124
msgid "Use the output in ``morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "Use a saída no ``morpheus.rb``:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:126
#, python-brace-format
msgid "opensearch['morpheus_password'] = 'ENC{aBcDeFgHiJkLmNoPqRsTuVwXyZ...}'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:130
msgid ""
"The encryption uses the appliance's ``encryption_key_suffix`` (from "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json``), so the encrypted value is "
"specific to that appliance. All nodes in the cluster share the same "
"secrets file contents."
msgstr "A criptografia usa o ``encryption_key_suffix`` do appliance (de ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json``), portanto o valor criptografado é específico daquele appliance. Todos os nós do cluster compartilham o mesmo conteúdo do arquivo de segredos."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:133
msgid "Single Node (Embedded)"
msgstr "Nó Único (Incorporado)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:135
msgid ""
"A single-node setup uses the embedded OpenSearch service with default "
"settings. No ``morpheus.rb`` changes are required unless enabling secure "
"mode."
msgstr "Uma configuração de nó único usa o serviço OpenSearch incorporado com as configurações padrão. Nenhuma alteração no ``morpheus.rb`` é necessária, a menos que se ative o modo seguro."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:137
msgid ""
"The embedded OpenSearch service starts automatically after reconfigure. "
"To enable secure mode:"
msgstr "O serviço OpenSearch incorporado inicia automaticamente após o reconfigure. Para ativar o modo seguro:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:139
msgid "opensearch['secure_mode'] = true"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:144
msgid "3-Node Embedded Cluster"
msgstr "Cluster Incorporado de 3 Nós"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:147
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:149
msgid "**Networking:**"
msgstr "**Rede:**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:151
msgid ""
"All 3 nodes must be able to reach each other on ports 9200 (HTTP) and "
"9300 (Transport)"
msgstr "Todos os 3 nós devem conseguir alcançar uns aos outros nas portas 9200 (HTTP) e 9300 (Transporte)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:152
msgid "Each node needs a stable, routable IP address or resolvable hostname"
msgstr "Cada nó precisa de um endereço IP ou hostname resolvível estável e roteável"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:153
msgid ""
"Both IP addresses and hostnames are supported in ``es_hosts`` and "
"``publish_ip``"
msgstr "Tanto endereços IP quanto hostnames são suportados em ``es_hosts`` e ``publish_ip``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:155
msgid "**Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Configuração:**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:157
msgid "Each node must have the same ``es_hosts`` hash listing all 3 nodes"
msgstr "Cada nó deve ter o mesmo hash ``es_hosts`` listando todos os 3 nós"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:158
msgid "A unique ``node_name`` per node"
msgstr "Um ``node_name`` exclusivo por nó"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:159
msgid "A unique ``publish_ip`` matching that node's routable IP"
msgstr "Um ``publish_ip`` exclusivo correspondente ao IP roteável daquele nó"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:160
msgid "``host`` set to ``0.0.0.0`` (default ``127.0.0.1`` only listens locally)"
msgstr "``host`` definido como ``0.0.0.0`` (o padrão ``127.0.0.1`` só escuta localmente)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:161
msgid "All nodes must share the same ``cluster`` name (defaults to ``morpheus``)"
msgstr "Todos os nós devem compartilhar o mesmo nome de ``cluster`` (o padrão é ``morpheus``)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:163
msgid "**Example nodes:**"
msgstr "**Nós de exemplo:**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:165
msgid "Node 1: ``10.0.0.1`` (morpheus-1)"
msgstr "Nó 1: ``10.0.0.1`` (morpheus-1)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:166
msgid "Node 2: ``10.0.0.2`` (morpheus-2)"
msgstr "Nó 2: ``10.0.0.2`` (morpheus-2)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:167
msgid "Node 3: ``10.0.0.3`` (morpheus-3)"
msgstr "Nó 3: ``10.0.0.3`` (morpheus-3)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:170
msgid "Without Secure Mode"
msgstr "Sem Modo Seguro"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:172
msgid "**Node 1** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "**Nó 1** — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"

